{!c&&page==='Companies'&&<><div className="page-heading"><div><div className="eyebrow">01 / BUILD YOUR UNIVERSE</div><h1>Good businesses.<br/><span>Clear evidence.</span></h1><p>Relationships start long before a business becomes a deal.</p></div><div className="button-row"><button className="btn" onClick={()=>setModal('import')}><Upload size={16}/>Import CSV</button><button className="btn primary" onClick={()=>setModal('add')}><Plus size={16}/>Add company</button></div></div><div className="discovery-bar"><Globe2 size={22}/><div><strong>Your search starts in NJ + NY.</strong><p>Research locksmith and access-control businesses. Add records or import your list.</p></div><a className="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/locksmith+access+control+New+Jersey+New+York" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Google Maps <ArrowUpRight size={15}/></a></div><section className="panel"><div className="table-toolbar"><label className="search-box"><Search size={18}/><input aria-label="Search companies" placeholder="Search companies, owners, or locations…" value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)}/></label><div className="button-row"><select aria-label="Filter stage" value={filter} onChange={e=>setFilter(e.target.value)}>{['All stages',...stages].map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select><select aria-label="Filter region" value={region} onChange={e=>setRegion(e.target.value)}>{['All regions',...new Set(w.companies.map(c=>c.state))].map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select><button className="icon-btn" aria-label="Export filtered companies" onClick={exportCSV}><Download size={18}/></button></div></div><div className="results-count">{visible.length} compan{visible.length===1?'y':'ies'} <span>·</span> {filter==='All stages'?'All relationship stages':filter}</div><Table/></section><p className="footnote">Google Maps opens externally. Live discovery and paid enrichment are not connected.</p></>}
